      "raw_answer": "```json\n{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"auth-package-refactor\",\n      \"title\": \"Split monolithic app/auth.py into app/auth/ package (tokens, roles, api_keys, __init__)\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The PR deletes the single-file app/auth.py and re-creates its contents as a package: app/auth/tokens.py (hash_password, issue_token, get_current_user, require_auth), app/auth/roles.py (ROLE_RANK, require_role, is_owner_or_admin), app/auth/api_keys.py (get_api_key, require_api_key_scope), and app/auth/__init__.py which re-exports the same public names so existing `from app.auth import ...` imports in app/main.py, app/routes/admin.py, app/routes/orders.py, and app/routes/users.py continue to resolve. All five hunks are one logical refactor of the same authorization surface and must be reviewed together to confirm the re-exported decorators and helpers are behaviorally identical to the deleted module.\",\n      \"hunks\": [\n        \"app/auth.py#0\",\n        \"app/auth/__init__.py#0\",\n        \"app/auth/tokens.py#0\",\n        \"app/auth/roles.py#0\",\n        \"app/auth/api_keys.py#0\"\n      ],\n      \"context\": [\n        {\"path\": \"app/main.py\", \"symbol\": \"login\", \"start_line\": 19, \"end_line\": 28, \"snapshot\": \"pr\", \"why\": \"Imports hash_password and issue_token from app.auth; verifies the package re-export preserves the login token flow.\"},\n        {\"path\": \"app/routes/users.py\", \"symbol\": \"get_user\", \"start_line\": 28, \"end_line\": 38, \"snapshot\": \"pr\", \"why\": \"Uses require_auth and is_owner_or_admin from app.auth; confirms the re-exported names still satisfy the owner-or-admin access rule.\"},\n        {\"path\": \"app/routes/orders.py\", \"symbol\": \"all_orders\", \"start_line\": 50, \"end_line\": 56, \"snapshot\": \"pr\", \"why\": \"Uses require_role('manager') from app.auth; confirms the role gate re-export is intact.\"},\n        {\"path\": \"app/routes/admin.py\", \"symbol\": \"stats\", \"start_line\": 18, \"end_line\": 29, \"snapshot\": \"pr\", \"why\": \"Uses require_role('admin') from app.auth; confirms the admin role gate re-export is intact.\"},\n        {\"path\": \"app/models.py\", \"symbol\": \"ApiKey\", \"start_line\": 65, \"end_line\": 75, \"snapshot\": \"pr\", \"why\": \"Defines the ApiKey model (key, scope) that get_api_key and require_api_key_scope query and scope-check against.\"},\n        {\"path\": \"app/models.py\", \"symbol\": \"User\", \"start_line\": 23, \"end_line\": 40, \"snapshot\": \"pr\", \"why\": \"Defines the User model (role, password_hash) that tokens.py and roles.py resolve and rank.\"}\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
